    "## Section 4 — Class Weights\n",
    "Medical datasets are often **imbalanced** — more benign than malignant nodules.\n",
    "Without correction, the model could achieve high accuracy by always predicting\n",
    "'benign', missing every malignant nodule — which is clinically dangerous.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Class weights** fix this by penalizing errors on the minority class more heavily,\n",
    "forcing the model to take both classes seriously.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 9,
   "metadata": {},
