    "## Section 7 — 3D CNN Model Architecture\n",
    "\n",
    "### How a CNN learns\n",
    "A CNN passes input through convolutional layers. Each layer applies filters\n",
    "that slide across the volume detecting patterns. Early layers detect simple\n",
